        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I thought I have resolved this, but I didn't take into account that tab width is computed based on the `config.format` output. If it contains any special constructs (like `%#HLname#`, for example), it interferes with computing which tabs should be shown.\r\n\r\nThis needs more time and effort, I am afraid.",
