            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I am afraid I have to close with resolution \"'mini.tabline' can have only predefined set of full tab colors\". Another way to put it is \"an output of `config.format` will be treated strictly as text\".\r\n\r\nThe full explanation is in 70862cc80182dfb6ff6f0e869c439011e4e874b8 commit message. TL;DR:\r\n- Allowing colored icons requires respecting special 'statusline' like constructs in output of `config.format`.\r\n- It conflicts with the requirement of being able to partially show a tab.\r\n- Together with other complexity issues I think it is reasonable to document this as a known limitation.",
